nre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "はじめまして！\n創作活動で他デザイナー様に作成してもらったオリキャラの\nイメージを広げるため二次創作を御願いしたいです。\n\n未来世界で活躍するアンドロイドＡＩキャラです。\n所属する勢力の軍師的な役割を担い頭脳派ですが、\n勝手に一人旅に出てしまうような気まぐれだったりします。\n見た目は吊り眼が特徴で、性格はツンデレです。\n参考画像の一輪車バイクは描かなくても問題ないです。\n\n使用したい範囲は\n自前の紹介サイトや、ＳＮＳでの掲載となります。\n※トリミング使用も予定しています。\n\n御面倒かけますが\nよろしく御検討ください！\n\nhttps://twitter.com/oniyatsuhashi/status/1439648742575984648?s=20", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@James_Bondy_/works/3", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/37f73115/uploads/origins/1b372fb3-3b21-47fe-8034-d43c64ec2bf6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b55392a8dd78f2412c2c3c92eab90799", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/37f73115/uploads/origins/1b372fb3-3b21-47fe-8034-d43c64ec2bf6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b55392a8dd78f2412c2c3c92eab90799, https://si.imgix.net/37f73115/uploads/origins/1b372fb3-3b21-47fe-8034-d43c64ec2bf6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ef5603a5697b26b58c20c1e6bb418315 2x, https://si.imgix.net/37f73115/uploads/origins/1b372fb3-3b21-47fe-8034-d43c64ec2bf6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=24842dea2df812a42454a9144324c27f 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Nice to meet you. I love your art. Looks amazing !I would love to see my characters drawn in your style~\nInformation:\nShe is a raccoon girl. \nShe has crystals in her skin and the liquid inside her body is poison.\nHer eyes are different color. One is blue, and the other one is gray. Gray eye always has poison tears.\nPlease notice the stripes on her hair on the left side.\nThe coat can be on or off. The raccoon pet is optional, only draw the pet if you really want to.\n\nPose and expression is up to you.\nPlease have fun!\n\nCharacter: https://imgur.com/a/rDyHtat", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@James_Bondy_/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgi